<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But hurry back out here once you finish with all that.”</span> He adds with a glare, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Only way someone gets out of the whole class is with a doctor’s note or a missing limb! Hurry up now, before I change my mind!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mason</span> quickly runs off towards the locker room. You don’t think much of it for the next 10 minutes of swimming, as even a school like Preston has the occasional bad food that may make someone sick, <span style="color:Yellow">but once the time has passed and he’s yet to return, you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> eyeing the locker room suspiciously.</span> <br>
