        Without thinking, you call out to the boy. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mason</span> jumps and looks at you as if all life is drained from his face. He quickly takes a step away from your locker and gives you a nervous smile. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>… Hey, wha- what are you doing here? Shouldn’t you be… in… class…?”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You stomp over, slamming your locker shut and ask him what the hell he is doing!</span> <br>
