    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I don’t know what… you are…”</span> He looks nervously between you and the locker, the picked lock on the ground which he quickly kicks out of sight. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, wait a second! This isn’t my locker! Haha, my… bad…”</span> He is really not the best at lying once he’s been caught. Calling him a thief and a pervert, you threaten to tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Coach Kohler</span> what you saw. This causes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mason</span>’s eyes to widen with fear. <br>
